// zig/presence's wire type -- deliberately minimal (a bare sequence number),
// unkeyed, single instance. The payload is incidental to this example; what
// matters is the LIVELINESS QoS on the writer and the reader's
// on_liveliness_changed transitions, not the data content. See
// docs/design/presence-reference-app.md at the repo root for the full spec.
// Byte-identical copy required in c/presence, cpp/presence, java/presence
// once those ports exist (same discipline hello_world.idl already follows
// across bindings).
@appendable
struct PresenceBeacon {
    int32 seq_num;
};
